        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nell Williams, Cersei Lannister, Lena Headey, George R. R. Martin, Daniel Huttlestone, Dougray Scott, Natascha McElhone, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Jeff Leach\n- Products: Game of Thrones, A Song of Ice and Fire, London Town, The Smoke\n- Roles: younger Cersei Lannister, adult Cersei Lannister, Dean, Ronnie\n\nFacts:\n- Cersei Lannister is a fictional character in George R. R. Martin's A Song of Ice and Fire novels and in the television adaptation Game of Thrones.\n- Lena Headey portrays Cersei Lannister in Game of Thrones as an adult.\n- In 2015, Nell Williams portrayed a younger version of Cersei Lannister in flashback sequences in the opening episode of Game of Thrones Season 5.\n- The 2016 film London Town stars Daniel Huttlestone, Dougray Scott, Natascha McElhone, Nell Williams, and Jonathan Rhys Meyers.\n- Jeff Leach is known for appearing in The Smoke as Dean and in London Town as Ronnie.",
